    "Learners are added to this cohort automatically.": "Nx\u00ebn\u00ebsit shtohen n\u00eb k\u00ebt\u00eb grup automatikisht.",
    "Learners are added to this cohort only when you provide their email addresses or usernames on this page.": "Nx\u00ebn\u00ebsit shtohen n\u00eb k\u00ebt\u00eb grup vet\u00ebm kur jepni adresat e tyre t\u00eb emailit ose emrat e p\u00ebrdoruesve n\u00eb k\u00ebt\u00eb faqe.",
    "Learners do not see question-level correctness or scores before or after the due date. However, once the due date passes, they can see their overall score for the subsection on the Progress page.": "Nx\u00ebn\u00ebsit nuk shohin sakt\u00ebsin\u00eb ose pik\u00ebt n\u00eb nivelin e pyetjeve para ose pas dat\u00ebs s\u00eb caktuar. Megjithat\u00eb, pasi t\u00eb kaloj\u00eb data e caktuar, ata mund t\u00eb shohin pik\u00ebt e tyre t\u00eb p\u00ebrgjithshme p\u00ebr n\u00ebnseksionin n\u00eb faqen e Progresit.",
    "Learners do not see the subsection in the course outline. The subsection is not included in grade calculations.": "Nx\u00ebn\u00ebsit nuk e shohin n\u00ebnseksionin n\u00eb skic\u00ebn e kursit. N\u00ebnseksioni nuk p\u00ebrfshihet n\u00eb llogaritjet e notave.",
    "Learners do not see whether their answers to assessments were correct or incorrect, nor the score received, until after the due date for the subsection has passed.": "Nx\u00ebn\u00ebsit nuk shohin n\u00ebse p\u00ebrgjigjet e tyre ndaj vler\u00ebsimeve ishin t\u00eb sakta apo t\u00eb pasakta, as pik\u00ebt e marra, derisa kalon data e duhur p\u00ebr n\u00ebnseksionin.",
    "Learners never see whether their answers to assessments are correct or incorrect, nor the score received.": "Nx\u00ebn\u00ebsit nuk e shohin kurr\u00eb n\u00ebse p\u00ebrgjigjet e tyre ndaj akces jan\u00eb t\u00eb sakta apo t\u00eb pasakta, as pik\u00ebt e marra.",
    "Learners who require verification must pass the selected checkpoint to see the content in this unit. Learners who do not require verification see this content by default.": "Nx\u00ebn\u00ebsit q\u00eb k\u00ebrkojn\u00eb verifikim duhet t\u00eb kalojn\u00eb pik\u00ebn e zgjedhur t\u00eb kontrollit p\u00ebr t\u00eb par\u00eb p\u00ebrmbajtjen n\u00eb k\u00ebt\u00eb nj\u00ebsi. Nx\u00ebn\u00ebsit q\u00eb nuk k\u00ebrkojn\u00eb verifikim e shohin k\u00ebt\u00eb p\u00ebrmbajtje si parazgjedhje.",
