    "Thank you for submitting a request! We appreciate your patience while we work to review your request.": "Faleminderit p\u00ebr dor\u00ebzimin e nj\u00eb k\u00ebrkese! Ne e vler\u00ebsojm\u00eb durimin tuaj nd\u00ebrsa punojm\u00eb p\u00ebr t\u00eb shqyrtuar k\u00ebrkes\u00ebn tuaj.",
    "Thank you for submitting your financial assistance application for {course_name}! You can expect a response in 2-4 business days.": "Faleminderit q\u00eb d\u00ebrguat aplikacionin tuaj p\u00ebr ndihm\u00eb financiare p\u00ebr {course_name} ! Ju mund t\u00eb prisni nj\u00eb p\u00ebrgjigje n\u00eb 2-4 dit\u00eb pune.",
    "Thank you for submitting your photos. We will review them shortly. You can now sign up for any %(platformName)s course that offers verified certificates. Verification is good for one year. After one year, you must submit photos for verification again.": "Faleminderit p\u00ebr dor\u00ebzimin e fotove tuaja. Ne do t&#39;i shqyrtojm\u00eb ato s\u00eb shpejti. Tani mund t\u00eb regjistroheni p\u00ebr \u00e7do kurs %(platformName)s q\u00eb ofron certifikata t\u00eb verifikuara. Verifikimi \u00ebsht\u00eb i mir\u00eb p\u00ebr nj\u00eb vit. Pas nj\u00eb viti, duhet t\u00eb dor\u00ebzoni s\u00ebrish foto p\u00ebr verifikim.",
    "Thanks for returning to verify your ID in: {courseName}": "Faleminderit q\u00eb u kthyet p\u00ebr t\u00eb verifikuar ID-n\u00eb tuaj n\u00eb: {courseName}",
    "The URL you entered seems to be an email address. Do you want to add the required mailto: prefix?": "URL-ja q\u00eb fut\u00ebt duket se \u00ebsht\u00eb nj\u00eb adres\u00eb emaili. D\u00ebshironi t\u00eb shtoni prefiksin e k\u00ebrkuar mailto:?",
    "The URL you entered seems to be an external link. Do you want to add the required http:// prefix?": "URL-ja q\u00eb fut\u00ebt duket se \u00ebsht\u00eb nj\u00eb lidhje e jashtme. D\u00ebshironi t\u00eb shtoni prefiksin e k\u00ebrkuar http://?",
    "The assignment type must have a name.": "Lloji i detyr\u00ebs duhet t\u00eb ket\u00eb nj\u00eb em\u00ebr.",
    "The certificate available date must be later than the course end date.": "Data e disponueshme e certifikat\u00ebs duhet t\u00eb jet\u00eb m\u00eb von\u00eb se data e p\u00ebrfundimit t\u00eb kursit.",
    "The certificate display behavior must be one of: {behavior_options}": "Sjellja e shfaqjes s\u00eb certifikat\u00ebs duhet t\u00eb jet\u00eb nj\u00eb nga: {behavior_options}",
    "The certificate for this learner has been re-validated and the system is re-running the grade for this learner.": "Certifikata p\u00ebr k\u00ebt\u00eb nx\u00ebn\u00ebs \u00ebsht\u00eb ri-vleft\u00ebsoi dhe sistemi ridrejtoi not\u00ebn p\u00ebr k\u00ebt\u00eb nx\u00ebn\u00ebs.",
    "The certificates display behavior must be {valid_option} if certificate available date is set.": "Sjellja e shfaqjes s\u00eb certifikatave duhet t\u00eb jet\u00eb {valid_option} n\u00ebse \u00ebsht\u00eb caktuar data e disponueshme e certifikat\u00ebs.",
