    "The number of subsections in the course that contain problems of this assignment type.": "Numri i n\u00ebnseksioneve n\u00eb kurs q\u00eb p\u00ebrmbajn\u00eb probleme t\u00eb k\u00ebtij lloji t\u00eb detyr\u00ebs.",
    "The number of {type} assignments defined here does not match the current number of {type} assignments in the course:": "Numri i detyrave {type} i p\u00ebrcaktuar k\u00ebtu nuk p\u00ebrputhet me numrin aktual t\u00eb detyrave {type} n\u00eb kurs:",
