    "This learner will be removed from the team,allowing another learner to take the available spot.": "Ky nx\u00ebn\u00ebs do t\u00eb hiqet nga ekipi, duke lejuar nj\u00eb nx\u00ebn\u00ebs tjet\u00ebr t\u00eb z\u00ebr\u00eb vendin e disponuesh\u00ebm.",
