    "This may be happening because of an error with our server or your internet connection. Try refreshing the page or making sure you are online.": "Kjo mund t\u00eb ndodh\u00eb p\u00ebr shkak t\u00eb nj\u00eb gabimi me serverin ton\u00eb ose lidhjen tuaj t\u00eb internetit. Provoni t\u00eb rifreskoni faqen ose t\u00eb siguroheni q\u00eb jeni n\u00eb linj\u00eb.",
