    "This problem has been reset.": "Problemi \u00ebsht\u00eb rivendosur.",
    "This proctored exam has been released to learners. You may not convert it to another type of special exam. You may revert this subsection back to being a basic exam by selecting 'None', or a timed exam, but you will NOT be able to configure it as a proctored exam in the future.": "Ky provim i kujdessh\u00ebm u \u00ebsht\u00eb dh\u00ebn\u00eb nx\u00ebn\u00ebsve. Ju nuk mund ta konvertoni at\u00eb n\u00eb nj\u00eb lloj tjet\u00ebr provimi special. Ju mund ta ktheni k\u00ebt\u00eb n\u00ebnseksion si nj\u00eb provim baz\u00eb duke zgjedhur 'Asnj\u00eb', ose nj\u00eb provim me koh\u00eb, por NUK do t\u00eb mund ta konfiguroni at\u00eb si nj\u00eb provim t\u00eb kujdessh\u00ebm n\u00eb t\u00eb ardhmen.",
    "This response could not be marked as an answer. Refresh the page and try again.": "Kjo p\u00ebrgjigje nuk mund t\u00eb sh\u00ebnohej si p\u00ebrgjigje. Rifresko faqen dhe provo s\u00ebrish.",
