    "This response could not be unendorsed. Refresh the page and try again.": "Kjo p\u00ebrgjigje nuk mund t\u00eb miratohet. Rifresko faqen dhe provo s\u00ebrish.",
    "This response could not be unmarked as an answer. Refresh the page and try again.": "Kjo p\u00ebrgjigje nuk mund t\u00eb hiqej si p\u00ebrgjigje. Rifresko faqen dhe provo s\u00ebrish.",
    "This role requires a divided discussions scheme.": "Ky rol k\u00ebrkon nj\u00eb skem\u00eb diskutimesh t\u00eb ndara.",
    "This short name for the assignment type (for example, HW or Midterm) appears next to assignments on a learner's Progress page.": "Ky em\u00ebr i shkurt\u00ebr p\u00ebr llojin e detyr\u00ebs (p\u00ebr shembull, HW ose Midterm) shfaqet pran\u00eb detyrave n\u00eb faqen e P\u00ebrparimit t\u00eb nj\u00eb nx\u00ebn\u00ebsi.",
    "This subsection is configured as \\\"%(gradingType)s\\\", which doesn't exist in the current grading policy.": "Ky n\u00ebnseksion \u00ebsht\u00eb konfiguruar si \\\"%(gradingType)s\\\", i cili nuk ekziston n\u00eb politik\u00ebn aktuale t\u00eb klasifikimit.",
    "This subsection was released to learners as a proctored exam, but was reverted back to a basic or timed exam. You may not configure it as a proctored exam now. Contact edX Support for assistance.": "Ky n\u00ebnseksion u l\u00ebshua p\u00ebr nx\u00ebn\u00ebsit si nj\u00eb provim i kujdessh\u00ebm, por u kthye p\u00ebrs\u00ebri n\u00eb nj\u00eb provim baz\u00eb ose n\u00eb koh\u00eb. Ju nuk mund ta konfiguroni at\u00eb si nj\u00eb provim t\u00eb kujdessh\u00ebm tani. Kontaktoni mb\u00ebshtetjen e edX p\u00ebr ndihm\u00eb.",
