    "To hide the subsections and keep them accesible through links, you must adjust it from the section that contains them.": "P\u00ebr t\u00eb fshehur n\u00ebnseksionet dhe p\u00ebr t'i mbajtur ato t\u00eb arritshme p\u00ebrmes lidhjeve, duhet ta rregulloni at\u00eb nga seksioni q\u00eb i p\u00ebrmban.",
    "To invalidate a certificate for a particular learner, add the username or email address below.": "P\u00ebr t\u00eb zhvler\u00ebsuar nj\u00eb certifikat\u00eb p\u00ebr nj\u00eb nx\u00ebn\u00ebs t\u00eb caktuar, shtoni emrin e p\u00ebrdoruesit ose adres\u00ebn e emailit m\u00eb posht\u00eb.",
    "To receive a certificate, you must also verify your identity before {date}.": "P\u00ebr t\u00eb marr\u00eb nj\u00eb certifikat\u00eb, duhet t\u00eb verifikoni gjithashtu identitetin tuaj p\u00ebrpara {date}.",
    "To receive a certificate, you must also verify your identity.": "P\u00ebr t\u00eb marr\u00eb nj\u00eb certifikat\u00eb, duhet t\u00eb verifikoni gjithashtu identitetin tuaj.",
