    "To review learner cohort assignments or see the results of uploading a CSV file, download course profile information or cohort results on the {link_start}Data Download{link_end} page.": "P\u00ebr t\u00eb rishikuar detyrat e grupit t\u00eb nx\u00ebn\u00ebsve ose p\u00ebr t\u00eb par\u00eb rezultatet e ngarkimit t\u00eb nj\u00eb skedari CSV, shkarkoni informacionin e profilit t\u00eb kursit ose rezultatet e grupit n\u00eb faqen e shkarkimit t\u00eb t\u00eb dh\u00ebnave {link_start}Data Download{link_end}.",
    "To take a successful photo, make sure that:": "P\u00ebr t\u00eb b\u00ebr\u00eb nj\u00eb foto t\u00eb suksesshme, sigurohuni q\u00eb:",
