    "Use Onboarding to introduce learners to proctoring, verify their identity, and create an onboarding profile. Learners must complete the onboarding profile step prior to taking a proctored exam. Profile reviews take 2+ business days.": "P\u00ebrdorni Onboarding p\u00ebr t'i prezantuar nx\u00ebn\u00ebsit me proctoring, p\u00ebr t\u00eb verifikuar identitetin e tyre dhe p\u00ebr t\u00eb krijuar nj\u00eb profil onboarding. Nx\u00ebn\u00ebsit duhet t\u00eb plot\u00ebsojn\u00eb hapin e profilit t\u00eb hyrjes p\u00ebrpara se t\u00eb marrin nj\u00eb provim t\u00eb mbik\u00ebqyrur. Shqyrtimet e profilit zgjasin 2+ dit\u00eb pune.",
    "Use a practice proctored exam to introduce learners to the proctoring tools and processes. Results of a practice exam do not affect a learner's grade.": "P\u00ebrdorni nj\u00eb provim praktik p\u00ebr t'i prezantuar nx\u00ebn\u00ebsit me mjetet dhe proceset e v\u00ebzhgimit. Rezultatet e nj\u00eb provimi praktik nuk ndikojn\u00eb n\u00eb not\u00ebn e nx\u00ebn\u00ebsit.",
    "Use as a Prerequisite": "P\u00ebrdorni si kusht paraprak",
    "Use bookmarks to help you easily return to courseware pages. To bookmark a page, click \"Bookmark this page\" under the page title.": "P\u00ebrdorni faqesh\u00ebnuesit p\u00ebr t&#39;ju ndihmuar t\u00eb ktheheni me leht\u00ebsi n\u00eb faqet e programeve m\u00ebsimore. P\u00ebr t\u00eb sh\u00ebnuar nj\u00eb faqe, kliko &quot;sh\u00ebnjoni k\u00ebt\u00eb faqe&quot; n\u00ebn titullin e faqes.",
    "Use cohorts as the basis for dividing discussions. All learners, regardless of cohort, see the same discussion topics, but within divided topics, only members of the same cohort see and respond to each others\u2019 posts. ": "P\u00ebrdorni grupet si baz\u00eb p\u00ebr ndarjen e diskutimeve. T\u00eb gjith\u00eb nx\u00ebn\u00ebsit, pavar\u00ebsisht nga grupi, shohin t\u00eb nj\u00ebjtat tema diskutimi, por brenda temave t\u00eb ndara, vet\u00ebm an\u00ebtar\u00ebt e s\u00eb nj\u00ebjt\u00ebs grup i shohin dhe u p\u00ebrgjigjen postimeve t\u00eb nj\u00ebri-tjetrit. ",
    "Use enrollment tracks as the basis for dividing discussions. All learners, regardless of their enrollment track, see the same discussion topics, but within divided topics, only learners who are in the same enrollment track see and respond to each others\u2019 posts.": "P\u00ebrdorni gjurm\u00ebt e regjistrimit si baz\u00eb p\u00ebr ndarjen e diskutimeve. T\u00eb gjith\u00eb nx\u00ebn\u00ebsit, pavar\u00ebsisht nga pista e tyre e regjistrimit, shohin t\u00eb nj\u00ebjtat tema diskutimi, por brenda temave t\u00eb ndara, vet\u00ebm nx\u00ebn\u00ebsit q\u00eb jan\u00eb n\u00eb t\u00eb nj\u00ebjt\u00ebn pist\u00eb regjistrimi i shohin dhe u p\u00ebrgjigjen postimeve t\u00eb nj\u00ebri-tjetrit.",
    "Use my institution/campus credentials": "P\u00ebrdorni kredencialet e mia t\u00eb institucionit/kampusit",
    "Use my university info": "P\u00ebrdorni informacionin tim t\u00eb universitetit",
