    "Warnings": "Paralajm\u00ebrimet",
    "We ask you to activate your account to ensure it is really you creating the account and to prevent fraud.": "Ne ju k\u00ebrkojm\u00eb t\u00eb aktivizoni llogarin\u00eb tuaj p\u00ebr t\u00eb siguruar q\u00eb jeni v\u00ebrtet ju q\u00eb krijoni llogarin\u00eb dhe p\u00ebr t\u00eb parandaluar mashtrimin.",
    "We couldn't create your account.": "Nuk mundemi t\u00eb krijojm\u00eb llogarin\u00eb tuaj.",
    "We couldn't find any results for \"%s\".": "Nuk mund t\u00eb gjenim asnj\u00eb rezultat p\u00ebr \"%s\".",
    "We couldn't sign you in.": "Nuk mund\u00ebm t\u00eb t\u00eb identifikohemi.",
    "We have encountered an error. Refresh your browser and then try again.": "Kemi hasur n\u00eb nj\u00eb gabim. Rifresko shfletuesin dhe m\u00eb pas provo s\u00ebrish.",
    "We have received your information and are verifying your identity. You will see a message on your dashboard when the verification process is complete (usually within 5-7 days). In the meantime, you can still access all available course content.": "Ne kemi marr\u00eb informacionin tuaj dhe po verifikojm\u00eb identitetin tuaj. Do t\u00eb shihni nj\u00eb mesazh n\u00eb pultin tuaj kur procesi i verifikimit t\u00eb p\u00ebrfundoj\u00eb (zakonisht brenda 5-7 dit\u00ebve). Nd\u00ebrkoh\u00eb, ju ende mund t\u00eb p\u00ebrdorni t\u00eb gjith\u00eb p\u00ebrmbajtjen e disponueshme t\u00eb kursit.",
    "We just need a little more information before you start learning with %(platformName)s.": "Na duhet vet\u00ebm pak m\u00eb shum\u00eb informacion p\u00ebrpara se t\u00eb filloni t\u00eb m\u00ebsoni me %(platformName)s.",
    "We securely encrypt your photo and send it to our authorization service for review. Your photo and information are not saved or visible anywhere on %(platformName)s after the verification process is complete.": "Ne e kodojm\u00eb n\u00eb m\u00ebnyr\u00eb t\u00eb sigurt foton tuaj dhe e d\u00ebrgojm\u00eb at\u00eb n\u00eb sh\u00ebrbimin ton\u00eb t\u00eb autorizimit p\u00ebr shqyrtim. Fotografia dhe informacioni juaj nuk ruhen ose shihen askund n\u00eb %(platformName)s pas p\u00ebrfundimit t\u00eb procesit t\u00eb verifikimit.",
    "We use the highest levels of security available to encrypt your photo and send it to our authorization service for review. Your photo and information are not saved or visible anywhere on %(platformName)s after the verification process is complete.": "Ne p\u00ebrdorim nivelet m\u00eb t\u00eb larta t\u00eb siguris\u00eb n\u00eb dispozicion p\u00ebr t\u00eb enkriptuar foton tuaj dhe p\u00ebr ta d\u00ebrguar at\u00eb te sh\u00ebrbimi yn\u00eb i autorizimit p\u00ebr shqyrtim. Fotografia dhe informacioni juaj nuk ruhen ose shihen askund n\u00eb %(platformName)s pas p\u00ebrfundimit t\u00eb procesit t\u00eb verifikimit.",
    "We use your verification photos to confirm your identity and ensure the validity of your certificate.": "Ne p\u00ebrdorim fotot tuaja t\u00eb verifikimit p\u00ebr t\u00eb konfirmuar identitetin tuaj dhe p\u00ebr t\u00eb siguruar vlefshm\u00ebrin\u00eb e certifikat\u00ebs tuaj.",
    "We're sorry to see you go! Your account will be deleted shortly.": "Na vjen keq q\u00eb t\u00eb shohim t\u00eb shkosh! Llogaria juaj do t\u00eb fshihet s\u00eb shpejti.",
    "We're sorry, there was an error": "Na vjen keq, ndodhi nj\u00eb gabim.",
    "We've encountered an error. Refresh your browser and then try again.": "Ka hasur n\u00eb nj\u00eb gabim. Rifresko shfletuesin dhe m\u00eb pas provo s\u00ebrish.",
