    "We\u2019re sorry to see you go!": "Na vjen keq q\u00eb po largohesh!",
    "What You Need for Verification": "\u00c7far\u00eb ju nevojitet p\u00ebr verifikim",
    "What does %(platformName)s do with this photo?": "\u00c7far\u00eb b\u00ebn %(platformName)s me k\u00ebt\u00eb foto?",
    "What does this mean?": "\u00c7far\u00eb do t\u00eb thot\u00eb kjo?",
    "What if I can't see the camera image, or if I can't see my photo do determine which side is visible?": "Po n\u00ebse nuk mund ta shoh imazhin e kamer\u00ebs ose n\u00ebse nuk mund ta shoh foton time p\u00ebr t\u00eb p\u00ebrcaktuar se cila an\u00eb \u00ebsht\u00eb e dukshme?",
    "What if I have difficulty holding my ID in position relative to the camera?": "Po sikur t\u00eb kem v\u00ebshtir\u00ebsi n\u00eb mbajtjen e ID-s\u00eb n\u00eb pozicionin n\u00eb lidhje me kamer\u00ebn?",
    "What if I have difficulty holding my head in position relative to the camera?": "Po sikur t\u00eb kem v\u00ebshtir\u00ebsi t\u00eb mbaj kok\u00ebn n\u00eb nj\u00eb pozicion n\u00eb lidhje me kamer\u00ebn?",
    "What's in my clipboard?": "\u00c7far\u00eb ka n\u00eb clipboard-in tim?",
    "When learners submit an answer to an assessment, they immediately see whether the answer is correct or incorrect, and the score received.": "Kur nx\u00ebn\u00ebsit paraqesin nj\u00eb p\u00ebrgjigje p\u00ebr nj\u00eb vler\u00ebsim, ata menj\u00ebher\u00eb shohin n\u00ebse p\u00ebrgjigja \u00ebsht\u00eb e sakt\u00eb apo e pasakt\u00eb dhe rezultati i marr\u00eb.",
    "When sharing this link with your learners, they will see the content of the subsection along with the header and footer of your LMS.": "Kur ndani k\u00ebt\u00eb lidhje me nx\u00ebn\u00ebsit tuaj, ata do t\u00eb shohin p\u00ebrmbajtjen e n\u00ebnseksioneve s\u00eb bashku me kok\u00ebn dhe fundin e LMS-s\u00eb tuaj.",
    "When your face is in position, use the Take Photo button {icon} below to take your photo.": "Kur fytyra juaj \u00ebsht\u00eb n\u00eb pozicion, p\u00ebrdorni butonin \"B\u00ebni foton\" {icon} m\u00eb posht\u00eb p\u00ebr t\u00eb b\u00ebr\u00eb foton tuaj.",
    "Which timed transcript would you like to use?": "Cilin transkript t\u00eb caktuar do t\u00eb d\u00ebshironit t\u00eb p\u00ebrdorni?",
    "While our support team is happy to assist with the edX platform, the course staff has the expertise for specific assignment questions, grading or the proper procedures in each course. Please post all course related questions within the Discussion Forum where the Course Staff can directly respond.": "Nd\u00ebrsa ekipi yn\u00eb mb\u00ebshtet\u00ebs \u00ebsht\u00eb i lumtur t\u00eb ndihmoj\u00eb me platform\u00ebn edX, stafi i kursit ka ekspertiz\u00ebn p\u00ebr pyetjet e detyrave specifike, notimin ose procedurat e duhura n\u00eb secilin kurs. Ju lutemi postoni t\u00eb gjitha pyetjet n\u00eb lidhje me kursin brenda Forumit t\u00eb Diskutimit ku Stafi i Kursit mund t\u00eb p\u00ebrgjigjet drejtp\u00ebrdrejt.",
    "Whole words": "Fjal\u00eb t\u00eb t\u00ebra",
