    "Would you like to permanently ignore this updated version? If so, you won't be able to update this until a newer version is published (in the library).": "D\u00ebshiron ta shp\u00ebrfill\u00ebsh p\u00ebrgjithmon\u00eb k\u00ebt\u00eb version t\u00eb p\u00ebrdit\u00ebsuar? N\u00ebse po, nuk do t\u00eb mund ta p\u00ebrdit\u00ebsoni k\u00ebt\u00eb derisa t\u00eb publikohet nj\u00eb version m\u00eb i ri (n\u00eb bibliotek\u00eb).",
