    "You can no longer change sessions.": "Nuk mund t\u00eb ndryshosh m\u00eb sesione.",
    "You can now enter your payment information and complete your enrollment.": "Tani mund t\u00eb futni informacionin tuaj t\u00eb pages\u00ebs dhe t\u00eb p\u00ebrfundoni regjistrimin.",
    "You can pay now even if you don't have the following items available, but you will need to have these by {date} to qualify to earn a Verified Certificate.": "Mund t\u00eb paguani tani edhe n\u00ebse nuk i keni n\u00eb dispozicion artikujt e m\u00ebposht\u00ebm, por do t'ju duhet t'i keni k\u00ebto deri n\u00eb {date} p\u00ebr t'u kualifikuar p\u00ebr t\u00eb fituar nj\u00eb Certifikat\u00eb t\u00eb Verifikuar.",
    "You can pay now even if you don't have the following items available, but you will need to have these to qualify to earn a Verified Certificate.": "Mund t\u00eb paguani tani edhe n\u00ebse nuk i keni n\u00eb dispozicion artikujt e m\u00ebposht\u00ebm, por do t'ju duhet t'i keni k\u00ebto p\u00ebr t'u kualifikuar p\u00ebr t\u00eb fituar nj\u00eb Certifikat\u00eb t\u00eb Verifikuar.",
    "You can remove members from this team, especially if they have not participated in the team's activity.": "Ju mund t\u00eb hiqni an\u00ebtar\u00ebt nga ky ekip, ve\u00e7an\u00ebrisht n\u00ebse ata nuk kan\u00eb marr\u00eb pjes\u00eb n\u00eb aktivitetin e ekipit.",
    "You can view your information or unlink from {enterprise_name} anytime in your Account Settings.": "Mund t\u00eb shikoni informacionin tuaj ose t\u00eb shk\u00ebputeni nga {enterprise_name} n\u00eb \u00e7do koh\u00eb te cil\u00ebsimet e llogaris\u00eb tuaj.",
    "You cannot view the course as a student or beta tester before the course release date.": "Ju nuk mund ta shikoni kursin si student ose testues beta p\u00ebrpara dat\u00ebs s\u00eb l\u00ebshimit t\u00eb kursit.",
    "You changed a video URL, but did not change the timed transcript file. Do you want to use the current timed transcript or upload a new .srt transcript file?": "Ndryshove URL-n\u00eb e videos, por nuk e ndryshove skedarin e transkriptit t\u00eb caktuar n\u00eb koh\u00eb. D\u00ebshiron t\u00eb p\u00ebrdor\u00ebsh transkriptin aktual me koh\u00eb ose t\u00eb ngarkosh nj\u00eb skedar t\u00eb ri transkripti .srt?",
    "You commented...": "Ju komentove...",
    "You could not be subscribed to this post. Refresh the page and try again.": "Ju nuk mund t\u00eb abonoheni n\u00eb k\u00ebt\u00eb postim. Rifresko faqen dhe provo s\u00ebrish.",
    "You could not be unsubscribed from this post. Refresh the page and try again.": "Nuk mund t\u00eb \u00e7regjistrohesh nga ky postim. Rifresko faqen dhe provo s\u00ebrish.",
    "You currently have no cohorts configured": "Aktualisht nuk keni grupe t\u00eb konfiguruara",
    "You did not select a content group": "Nuk zgjodh\u00ebt nj\u00eb grup p\u00ebrmbajtjesh",
    "You did not select any files to submit.": "Nuk keni zgjedhur asnj\u00eb skedar p\u00ebr t\u00eb dor\u00ebzuar.",
