    "Your changes will not take effect until you save your progress. Take care with key and value formatting, as validation is not implemented.": "Ndryshimet tuaja nuk do t\u00eb hyjn\u00eb n\u00eb fuqi derisa t\u00eb ruani p\u00ebrparimin tuaj. Kujdes me formatimin e \u00e7el\u00ebsave dhe vlerave, pasi v\u00ebrtetimi nuk zbatohet.",
